.el .ds Aq '
.TH hon 1  "hon 0.1.0" 
.SH NAME
hon \- Read manga in your terminal
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBhon\fR [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] [\fB\-V\fR|\fB\-\-version\fR] [\fIcommand\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Read manga in your terminal
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
\fB\-V\fR, \fB\-\-version\fR
Print version
.SH COMMANDS
.SS "hon search"
\fBhon search\fR <\fIQUERY\fR> 
.PP
Search every source and print grouped results
.TP
<\fIQUERY\fR>
Title or part of one
.SS "hon download"
\fBhon download\fR [\fB\-\-source\fR] [\fB\-\-format\fR] <\fITITLE\fR> <\fICHAPTERS\fR> 
.PP
Download chapters, e.g. `hon download "solo leveling" 1\-10`
.TP
\fB\-\-source\fR \fI<SOURCE>\fR
Source to download from (default: the one with the newest chapter)
.TP
\fB\-\-format\fR \fI<FORMAT>\fR
File format (default: `format` from the config file, else pdf)
.br

.br
\fIPossible values:\fR
.RS 14
.IP \(bu 2
pdf
.IP \(bu 2
cbz
.IP \(bu 2
images
.RE
.TP
<\fITITLE\fR>
Title; must match one series exactly, or be the only search result
.TP
<\fICHAPTERS\fR>
Chapters: `112`, `1\-10`, `1\-10,15,20.5` or `45\-` (to the latest)
.SS "hon read"
\fBhon read\fR [\fB\-\-source\fR] <\fITITLE\fR> [\fICHAPTER\fR] 
.PP
Open the reader at a chapter (default: where you left off)
.TP
\fB\-\-source\fR \fI<SOURCE>\fR
Source to read from (default: the one with the newest chapter)
.TP
<\fITITLE\fR>
Title; must match one series exactly, or be the only search result
.TP
[\fICHAPTER\fR]
Chapter number, e.g. `112` or `10.5`
.SH VERSION
v0.1.0
